  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "多么丰富多彩的颜色，不妨为我暂留吧。\n直到将那个世界、那些记忆，化为一份收藏。\n我承诺，你会得到与先前无异的一切。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-2.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-3.ancient": "不要再被他人煽动，等待吧。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-0.char": "上次我们的话还没说完呢！\n我确定有人在等我们……\n我们的归宿真实存在！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-0.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-1.char": "我们没空陪你搞什么收藏。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-1.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-2.ancient": "你……\n如果一道光能容下所有色彩，那他还会是「无色」吗？\n也许从这其中脱胎的「染料」，能为这一切重新上色。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-2.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-3.ancient": "极好的种子啊，停下。\n我不希望你被前方吞噬。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-0.char": "告诉我回去的办法！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-1.ancient": "你又来了吗？\n不管尝试多少次，你都……",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-2.char": "就算是这样，我们也会努力的。\n总有一天，我们会……",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-0r.char": "我是来向你告别的。\n我们要打败你，然后回去。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-1r.ancient": "告别是礼节，亦或是你的执着？\n为何你仍保持这样的仪式感，\n在我毫不犹豫地击溃你们无数次后？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-2r.char": "我只是要和你做个了结。\n虽然我还是搞不懂你，但我还是会跟你说再见。\n而且我们也早就做好回去的准备了。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-3r.char": "临空者号，准备返航！",
