  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.title": "泽塔",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.epithet": "红油勇者",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.pages.INITIAL.description": "红油勇者泽塔的宫殿。你可以带走一件她的收藏。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.0-0.ancient": "欢迎来到本勇者的宫殿！",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.0-0.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.0-1.ancient": "能告诉本勇者关于这里的事情吗？",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.0-1.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.0-2.ancient": "我……本勇者可以拿这些东西换！",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.1-0.ancient": "呜呜……大叔……狂战士……",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.1-0.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.1-1.ancient": "还有空之末裔……咦？",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.1-1.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.1-2.ancient": "你什么都没看见！\n拿上就走！",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.2-0r.ancient": "好无聊……",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.2-1r.ancient": "不如跟本勇者讲讲你们的故事！",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ANY.2-2r.ancient": "本勇者用战利品交易！",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "空之末裔？！怎么是你们？\n这里是哪里？\n勇者泽塔终于来到需要拯救的异世界了吗？",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "冷静一点，事情大概是这样……\n总之，这里看上去很安全，你别乱走。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "好难懂……\n总而言之，你会帮本勇者回去对吧？",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-2.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-3.ancient": "正好，本勇者找到了些东西，你看看吧。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-0.ancient": "空之末裔！你们不是上去了吗？\n怎么会从下面走上来！",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-0.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-1.char": "事情非常复杂……",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-1.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-2.ancient": "要不带上我吧，待在这里不能飙车，实在……\n太……太……太……无聊啦——",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "快看，本勇者已经交到原住民朋友了！\n咦？它怎么见到你们就跑。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "是上次偷了我们食物的人啊……",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-2r.char": "在我们回去之前，你还是小心点吧。\n不要乱和奇奇怪怪的人交朋友啊！",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_ZETA.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-visit": "2",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.title": "威廉",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.epithet": "隐修大师",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.pages.INITIAL.description": "隐修大师威廉坐在书海之中。你可以带走一件他的赠礼。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ANY.0-0.ancient": "「一位华丽的年轻人坐在宫殿中央的地上……\n他的周围摆满了书籍。」",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ANY.0-0.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ANY.0-1.ancient": "坐。茶？",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ANY.0-1.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ANY.0-2.ancient": "提防这里的茶？\n那你想要什么帮助？",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ANY.1-0.ancient": "坐。你想要怎样的招待？",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ANY.1-0.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ANY.1-1.ancient": "别误会——我并不喜欢闲聊。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ANY.1-1.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ANY.1-2.ancient": "但观察他人如同读书。\n一本新书感觉不错。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ANY.2-0r.ancient": "关于你曾讲过的故事……\n让我有些灵感。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ANY.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ANY.2-1r.ancient": "拿这些当作谢礼吧。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "[i][font_size=22]「一位华丽的年轻人坐在宫殿中央的地上……\n他的周围摆满了书籍。」[/font_size][/i]",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "……威廉先生？\n呃，好像哪里看到您也不惊讶。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "坐，我等你们很久了。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-0.ancient": "这里有太多值得我着迷的事情了。\n我还不打算离开。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-0.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-1.char": "但我们得回去啊。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-1.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.1-2.ancient": "我会继续提供帮助，你就好好加油吧。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-0.char": "隐修大师，我感觉您是不是有点乐在其中。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-1.ancient": "既然追求真理，又怎会抗拒崭新的未知？\n别担心，时机到了我也不会强留。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "至少此时此刻……\n让我们一同享受这次漂流的过程吧。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.2-visit": "2",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-0r.ancient": "眼神很不错，看来你找到诀窍了啊。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-0r.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-1r.char": "嗯，您呢？有收获吗？",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-1r.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-2r.ancient": "那还用说？年轻人，出发吧。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-2r.next": "继续",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-3r.ancient": "我吗？不必担心。\n我和「霜夜绅士」会顺流踏上回归之旅。",
  "ALCHEMY_STARS_ANCIENT_ALCHEMY_STARS_WILLIAM.talk.ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER_ALCHEMY_STARS_CHARACTER.3-visit": "3",
